# Netlify routing for this single-page app.
#
# Real pages are served the app with status 200. Anything else is served
# the same app (which shows the "Page not found" screen) but with status
# 404, so search engines do not index mistyped URLs as real pages.
#
# IMPORTANT: when you add a new page to src/App.jsx, add its path here too,
# or it will load fine but report itself to search engines as "not found".

# ---- One address for search engines: https://marudyaan.com -------------
# www.marudyaan.com moves visitors (and search rankings) to the bare
# domain. These rules only match requests for that host, so they do
# nothing until the domain's DNS points at Netlify.
https://www.marudyaan.com/*     https://marudyaan.com/:splat    301!
http://www.marudyaan.com/*      https://marudyaan.com/:splat    301!
#
# AFTER marudyaan.com is live on this site, remove the "# " in front of the
# next line so the old Netlify address forwards to the new one too.
# (Switching it on earlier would send visitors to a domain that is not
# serving the site yet.)
# https://ngo-marudyaan.netlify.app/*   https://marudyaan.com/:splat   301!

/about          /index.html   200
/our-work       /index.html   200
/gallery        /index.html   200
/get-involved   /index.html   200
/request-help   /index.html   200
/donate         /index.html   200
/contact        /index.html   200

/*              /index.html   404
